  "body": "## What's Changed\n* docs(release): record the tree-sitter cap in the 0.60.0 changelog by @RaghavChamadiya in https://github.com/repowise-dev/repowise/pull/5214\n* feat(cli): defer docs during index-only updates by @HengYangDS in https://github.com/repowise-dev/repowise/pull/5207\n* fix(decisions): fold a commit-mined decision into the PR decision of its merge by @RaghavChamadiya in https://github.com/repowise-dev/repowise/pull/2753\n* fix(decisions): fold a re-mined decision into the record that already holds it by @RaghavChamadiya in https://github.com/repowise-dev/repowise/pull/5221\n* feat(decisions): confirm a decision with a reason, and show where it came from by @RaghavChamadiya in https://github.com/repowise-dev/repowise/pull/5222\n* perf(update): rehydrate the health report instead of re-scoring every file by @RaghavChamadiya in https://github.com/repowise-dev/repowise/pull/5242\n* perf(update): let the graph patch engage when the update runs from a restored state by @RaghavChamadiya in https://github.com/repowise-dev/repowise/pull/5243\n* feat(update): report phase timings from the incremental repo update by @RaghavChamadiya in https://github.com/repowise-dev/repowise/pull/5244\n* feat(decisions): hand decisions to your agent to review and add by @RaghavChamadiya in https://github.com/repowise-dev/repowise/pull/5246\n* fix(update): write function facts only for the files an update re-scores by @RaghavChamadiya in https://github.com/repowise-dev/repowise/pull/5250\n* release: v0.60.1, decisions your agent can review, faster updates by @RaghavChamadiya in https://github.com/repowise-dev/repowise/pull/5249\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/repowise-dev/repowise/compare/v0.60.0...v0.60.1",
